prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Create one restrained premium hand-painted WOOD AND IVY game HUD FRAME ASSET SHEET, with exactly 24 blank hollow frames arranged in a clean 8 ROW x 3 COLUMN grid. Transparent alpha outside AND inside frames. No scene, no text, no numbers, no letters, no icons, no swatch labels, no baked checkerboard. Landscape canvas. Generous transparent spacing, all assets fully visible. Flat front-facing screen-space UI, no perspective.
STYLE: Much simpler and lighter than ornate fantasy HUD. Thin straight dark natural oak rails with softly worn corners and subtle visible wood grain. Small natural green ivy clusters of only 2-3 leaves at two corners per frame, thin unobtrusive short stems. Restrained crafted woodland look. No gold scrollwork, no jewels, no metal armor plates, no dramatic bevels, no thick carved ornaments, no heavy glow. Clean calm frames that do not distract from gameplay.
PARTIAL COLORING IS CRITICAL: All 24 frames retain IDENTICAL natural brown wood and natural olive-green ivy. Wood and ivy MUST NOT be recolored by row. At least 85 percent of visible frame material remains brown wood and green leaves. Only a hairline inset along the inner wood edge and two tiny corner binding details carry each row's accent color. Small muted colored accents, never full-frame color tint. This distinction must be obvious.
Three columns left to right: 1 wide shallow top-center status frame, aspect about 7:1, with two fine natural wood vertical dividers forming three empty fields; 2 bottom-center capacity/resource frame, aspect about 5:1, with a fine empty progress-track outline low inside; 3 right-side objective card, aspect about 4:1, free room for two text lines and a fine empty progress-track outline at bottom. Consistent frame structure, border thickness, wood color and ivy design across rows. No filled bars.
Eight rows top to bottom, accent color ONLY for the fine inlay and tiny corner bindings:
1 neutral silver-grey #819796 with #c7cfcc highlights;
2 warm gold #de9e41 with #e8c170 highlights;
3 subdued darker bronze #be772b with #7a4841 shadows, distinct from gold;
4 soft blue #4f8fba with #73bed3 highlights;
5 muted magenta-purple #a23e8c with #c65197 highlights;
6 fresh green #75a743 with #a8ca58 highlights (ivy remains identical olive green in every row);
7 burnt orange #d97030 with #f0a048 highlights;
8 brick red #a53030 with #cf573c highlights.
Keep the fine colored inlay distinguishable but understated. Professional raster game artwork, readable silhouettes, smooth clean edges, low visual noise, true transparency. Exactly eight rows, three columns.
